  "collspec.accueil.titre": "Special <br> Collections",

  "collspec.accueil.intro.lead": "Our special collections are filled with unique, old, and rare items, ready to enrich research and teaching, or even become objects of research themselves!",
  "collspec.accueil.intro.para1": "Browsing the different fonds means discovering the past through our rare and ancient books, artifacts, and image collections — from remarkable pieces to recent digitizations, explore our thematic selection of documents and objects from our fonds.",

  "collspec.accueil.vedette.titre": "Discover our unique pieces",

  "collspec.accueil.vedette.description": "Our special collections feature unique, historic, and rare materials with rich potential for research, study, and teaching. Browse the various collections and explore these exceptional resources through the digitized materials available on this site.",

  "collspec.accueil.vedette.description2": "The Université de Montréal Libraries network includes the Rare Books and Special Collections Library, a vibrant research laboratory where manuscripts, books, images, and other forms of expression open new avenues of discovery. On site, its team provides guidance for research as well as for accessing and working with the materials.",

